# This directory is PUBLIC. Everything is ignored by default and allowed one file at a
# time, so a stray note can never be published by accident.
# Never commit the refresh rules, source lists, methodology notes or any personal document here.
*
!index.html
!.nojekyll
!.gitignore

# Home-screen install (see publish.ps1 and tools\make-icons.ps1). These are generated,
# contain nothing private, and must be served or the board stops installing as an app.
!manifest.json
!sw.js
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!apple-touch-icon.png
!CNAME
